<title>USA: Avondale has 24.8 pct stake in Oneita.</title>
<headline>Avondale has 24.8 pct stake in Oneita.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oneita Industries Inc said Thursday it had issued 2,270,833 of its shares to Avondale Mills Inc in exchange for a $7.5 million 10 percent subordinate note held by Avondale.</p>
<p>Oneita said the exchange increases its shares outstanding to 9,149,339, of which 24.8 percent are owned by Avondale.</p>
</text>
